--- WHAM_files (PMF_react_TS1_beta) ---

Own copy of the shared WHAM scripts ('errors_wham1D.py', 'job_wham.sh', 'wham1D.py') used by
US/*/WHAM/ to reconstruct the dD free-energy profile for this isomer -- same scripts as
../../pph4/PMF_react_TS1/WHAM_files/ and ../PMF_react_TS1_alpha/WHAM_files/, see either for
what each script does. No 'slurm.err'/'slurm.out' present here, unlike alpha's copy --
suggesting WHAM has not yet been run (or was run without keeping the job log) for this branch
as of this review.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
